In this video I'm dropping the Flux 2 Klein Instagram Carousel Maker workflow — a fully wired ComfyUI setup that generates 10 carousel-ready images from a single reference photo. Just swap in your prompts, load your reference, and let it run. Each output is slightly varied in angle, pose, and expression while keeping your subject consistent across all slides — perfect for building out Instagram carousels fast.

The workflow uses Flux 2 Klein with ReferenceLatent to lock in your subject from the reference image, CR Prompt List to cycle through your 10 pose and angle variations, and FaceDetailer to keep facial consistency sharp across every output.

